      "tags": [
        "stack",
        "lifo",
        "pop",
        "order"
      ],
      "question": "The integers 1,2,3,4 are pushed into the stack in that order. They popped out of the stack. The integers, which are popped out are -",
      "options": {
        "A": "1,2,3,4",
        "B": "4,2,3,1",
        "C": "4,3,2,1",
        "D": "3,2,4,1"
      },
      "correct": "C",
      "explanation": "LIFO means the last value pushed leaves first: 4, then 3, 2 and finally 1. The output is 4,3,2,1, not the insertion order.",
      "topicQuality": "specific"
    },
    {
      "id": "CST205-U1-Q003",
