      "question": "Which among the following is a LIFO data structure?",
      "options": {
        "A": "Graph",
        "B": "Queue",
        "C": "Stack",
        "D": "Linked Lists"
      },
      "correct": "C",
      "explanation": "A stack removes the most recently added item first, which is LIFO. Queues are FIFO, while graphs and linked lists are not defined by that order rule.",
